Algorithm: Arithmetic Operations

1. Start
2. Declare variables A, B, SUM, DIFF, PROD, QUO, REM.
3. Read A and B.
4. Calculate SUM = A + B.
5. Calculate DIFF = A - B.
6. Calculate PROD = A x B.
7. Calculate QUO = A / B.
8. Calculate REM = A % B.
9. Display SUM, DIFF, PROD, QUO and REM.
10. Stop